m,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动豆包上线三档付费订阅服务，接入豆包2.1系列大模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anysphere发布Cursor自主训练大模型、Git平台Origin及iOS移动端App</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic推出企业级AI协同工具Claude Tag，实现Slack平台始终在线协作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美国AI初创公司Legion起诉政府，抗议限制外国公民访问Anthropic模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4a52fb32071ebcaa7e2befd2e8d1271f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美国AI初创公司Legion近日向华盛顿联邦法院提起诉讼，状告美国政府及商务部长卢特尼克，抗议政府限制Anthropic向外国公民提供Fable5和Mythos5模型。此前，为遵守出口管制规定，Anthropic已切断对Legion加拿大籍开发者的模型访问权限。Legion在诉状中指出，该限制导致公司失去核心开发工具，造成“立即、不可挽回且关乎存亡”的打击，严重削弱了其在激烈竞争中的生存能力。Anthropic对此回应称，将继续与政府合作以保护关键基础设施并确保美国AI领先地位。此案核心争议在于政府出口管制政策对AI企业跨国协作及日常运营的直接冲击，若限制持续，将对依赖前沿LLM的AI初创公司产生深远影响。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">火山引擎发布豆包音频生成模型1.0：一句话生成影视级音频，角色声音 10 分钟都不&quot;串戏&quot;</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/93f07e6ce176927d5342289a48466e28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">火山引擎发布豆包音频生成模型1.0：一句话生成影视级音频，角色声音 10 分钟都不&quot;串戏&quot;AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jun 24, 202616昨日，火山引擎正式发布豆包音频生成模型1.0（Doubao-Seed-Audio 1.0），支持将文本或音频任一模态作为输入，端到端生成完整音频作品。这款模型的核心突破在于：用一条Prompt就能搞定对白、音效、背景音乐的全要素生成，彻底告别人工多轨剪辑的传统工作流。一句话变身&quot;音频导演&quot;，省去所有后期 过去，一段成片级音频作品意味着对白、音效、配乐逐条生成、手动对齐、多轨混音，流程繁琐且高度依赖后期技术能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动豆包上线三档付费订阅服务，接入豆包2.1系列大模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e37e983a1c8301b5555831ce3f9b61de.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月24日，字节跳动旗下AI助手豆包正式开启商业化进程，上线三档付费订阅服务，并全面接入全新升级的豆包2.1系列大模型。付费版分为标准版（68元/月）、加强版（200元/月）及高级版（500元/月），免费用户日常使用不受影响。此次定价策略极具本土竞争力，其中标准版价格约为海外主流AI服务（如ChatGPT Plus）的一半，高级版包年费用约5088元，仅为海外同类顶配服务的约三分之一。豆包此举旨在降低高阶AI能力的使用门槛，标志着国内大模型应用从“免费卷参数”阶段，正式跨入“高价值服务变现”的新周期，或将引发国内大模型应用层新一轮的商业化定价博弈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anysphere发布Cursor自主训练大模型、Git平台Origin及iOS移动端App</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/36291cef14512cad797ff97f8f54ee4b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI辅助编程工具Cursor开发商Anysphere在Compile26活动上宣布，将推出首个完全自主训练的基础模型，该模型参数规模对标Claude Opus与GPT系列，底层计算量提升至此前模型的10至20倍，预计未来几周内面世。同时，Anysphere发布了专为AI Agent协同设计的下一代Git平台Origin，该平台基于云原生架构，支持数千个Agent同时读写代码库，具备自动解决合并冲突与修复CI测试等能力，计划2026年秋季全面上线。此外，Cursor Mobile iOS测试版同步推出，支持用户远程管理AI Agent并处理任务。这一系列动作标志着Cursor正从单一IDE演变为涵盖模型、版本控制与移动端的综合性开发者生态平台，推动AI Agent规模化协作进入工程化落地阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic推出企业级AI协同工具Claude Tag，实现Slack平台始终在线协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/08153725c2814b5a913be00561b763e0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正式发布企业级AI工具Claude Tag，该工具深度集成于Slack平台，旨在通过“始终在线”的协同实体提升办公自动化水平。目前，Claude Tag测试版已向Claude Enterprise和Claude Team客户开放。与现有集成相比，Claude Tag引入了持久上下文与记忆层，能够长期追踪频道对话脉络，自主学习组织内部工作流与业务逻辑。在获得授权后，它可实现全组织范围的信息检索，并支持团队成员共享同一Claude身份以无缝衔接工作进度。系统管理员可对Claude身份的工具调用、信息获取范围及频道访问权限进行精细化配置，确保敏感数据安全。此外，Claude Tag具备“主动模式”，可自主加入群聊跟进遗忘议题，并将复杂任务解构为多阶段目标，通过调用多模态工具逐步推进并实时同步交付进展</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
